Bellone said he expects to use planning money to develop details of new rapid bus transit on Nicolls Road to tie research centers with downtowns and reduce reliance on cars. He also wants to move on proposals for a new train station at Brookhaven National Laboratory and a new terminal at MacArthur airport nearer the Ronkonkoma train station.
